<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NBS secures $70 million offshore loan.</title>
<headline>NBS secures $70 million offshore loan.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's NBS Bank said on Thursday it had secured a $70 million offshore loan from a club syndicate comprising seven international financial institutions.</p>
</text>
